      "content": "This profound sense of loss regarding your former self suggests a deep need to rebuild your sense of identity and purpose. When the foundation feels completely gone, the focus can shift from *being* to *exploring*. Small, new actions or conversations can sometimes begin to lay down a new foundation, however fragile it seems at first. Please consider speaking with a therapist who can help you gently explore this shifting sense of self.",
      "source": "target",
